@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### canonical resource URL: tenant / collection / item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee

### a verb in the path is not a resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/getProducts

### nesting a real sub-resource one level is fine
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/customers/cus_acme_01

### an invented deep path has no route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee/reviews/1/comments

### the tenant segment prevents ID guessing across shops
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_globex/products/prd_tee
